<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - AALBERTS H1 NET NLG 16.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>TABLE - AALBERTS H1 NET NLG 16.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 16.4    vs  11.2</p>
<p>    Operating profit			 29.1    vs  22.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial holding company Aalberts Industries NV said in February it expected a further increase in earnings per share in 1997.  </p>
<p>    Turnover				  300.3    vs 209.3</p>
<p>    Net per share (guilders)		1.05   vs   0.81</p>
<p>    Taxes					 6.76   vs   6.23</p>
<p>Aalberts Industries said all group activities had contributed positively to results. It said the order portfolio increased during the first half and most of its European markets had developed positively.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
